{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01476","headline":"舞曲歌辞 吴俞儿舞歌 劒俞 · 陆龟蒙","name":"舞曲歌辞 吴俞儿舞歌 劒俞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"枝月喉，櫂霜脊，北斗离离在寒碧。\n龙魂清，虎尾白，秋照海心同一色。\n纛影吒沙干影侧，神豪发直。\n四睨之人股佶栗，欲定不定定不得。\n舂牍残，儿且止。\n狄胡有胆大如山，怖亦死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01476.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01476","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}